t=3Dauto,onerror=3Dredirect,quality=3D80/uploads/asset/file/83b36a21-74ce-4=
c0f-83f6-1ce9ba09d40b/1789418509033.png?t=3D1789573380)
Follow image link: (https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/nyc-homes-selling-above-=
asking-highest-rate-four-years-streeteasy-1julc/)
Caption:=20

NYC home sales remained [highly competitive](https://www.linkedin.com/pulse=
/nyc-homes-selling-above-asking-highest-rate-four-years-streeteasy-1julc/) =
this summer, with 21.8% of homes selling above their latest asking price in=
 August after reaching 25.0% in July, the highest share since July 2022, as=
 pent-up buyer demand continues to support market activity.=C2=A0

