rd;"><p style=3D"mso-line-height-alt:170.0%;"><span style=3D"font-weight:70=
0;">A more flexible financing tool:</span> NYC=E2=80=99s C-PACE overhaul co=
uld make the program more useful for large-scale development, office conver=
sions and energy-efficient construction by increasing potential loan sizes =
and improving funding flexibility. For developers, the key shift may be bri=
nging C-PACE into the capital-stack discussion earlier in the project. </p>=
